        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-11T09:04:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Trajector - nice! I'm also an engineer but in a much more mundane field. I told my colleague that the story is good enough that you buy the science, and the science feels right, but I have never checked it for fear of it being bad.</p>",
